1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,337
Video ya leo ni kuhusu nini? Soko la Samaki la Toyosu.

2
00:00:07,337 --> 00:00:08,837
Sehemu ya 1: Utangulizi wa Soko la Toyosu

3
00:00:08,837 --> 00:00:12,845
Hapa ni Soko la Toyosu.

4
00:00:12,868 --> 00:00:15,549
Ni kubwa sana, hivi?

5
00:00:15,573 --> 00:00:20,940
Ndiyo. Ni soko jipya na safi.

6
00:00:20,963 --> 00:00:24,412
Je, ni kubwa kuliko Soko la Tsukiji?

7
00:00:24,435 --> 00:00:28,040
Ndiyo. Ni pana sana.

8
00:00:28,064 --> 00:00:31,064
Watu wengi sana hapa!

9
00:00:31,087 --> 00:00:34,579
Wageni wa kigeni pia wako wengi.

10
00:00:34,603 --> 00:00:38,769
Hufunguliwa saa ngapi kila siku?

11
00:00:38,792 --> 00:00:41,792
Hufunguliwa mapema asubuhi.

12
00:00:41,815 --> 00:00:44,656
Stesheni iko wapi?

13
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:47,913
Stesheni iko karibu sana hapa.

14
00:00:47,936 --> 00:00:50,203
Ni rahisi sana, basi!

15
00:00:50,226 --> 00:00:54,039
Ndiyo. Hata siku za mvua, hakuna matatizo.

16
00:00:54,063 --> 00:00:57,129
Haraka tuingie ndani.

17
00:00:57,152 --> 00:00:59,921
Ndiyo. Twende!

18
00:00:59,945 --> 00:01:03,220
Kuna harufu ya samaki, hivi?

19
00:01:03,244 --> 00:01:07,019
Kwa sababu kuna samaki wengi wa fresh.

20
00:01:07,042 --> 00:01:10,609
Mimi nina njaa.

21
00:01:10,632 --> 00:01:13,873
Kuna mikahawa mingi hapa.

22
00:01:13,897 --> 00:01:16,670
Tutakula nini?

23
00:01:16,693 --> 00:01:19,711
Kuna maduka mengi yenye vyakula tamu.

24
00:01:19,734 --> 00:01:22,201
Ni duka gani lipi bora?

25
00:01:22,224 --> 00:01:25,108
Tutafute pamoja.

26
00:01:25,131 --> 00:01:27,990
Kuna ramani huko.

27
00:01:28,014 --> 00:01:30,055
Tutazame.

28
00:01:30,079 --> 00:01:33,480
Mikahawa iko ghorofani.

29
00:01:33,503 --> 00:01:35,936
Kuna lifti.

30
00:01:35,959 --> 00:01:38,359
Tukipande hii.

31
00:01:38,382 --> 00:01:40,719
Nina hamu sana!

32
00:01:40,743 --> 00:01:43,950
Ndiyo. Haraka kidogo.

33
00:01:43,973 --> 00:01:52,982
Skripu ya video ya leo inaweza kupakuliwa kutoka maelezo na maoni ya juu. Tafadhali achia maoni kabla ya kupakua.

34
00:01:52,982 --> 00:01:54,482
Sehemu ya 2: Kupiga foleni katika Mgahawa maarufu wa Sushi

35
00:01:54,482 --> 00:01:57,616
Je, duka hili ni la namna gani?

36
00:01:57,639 --> 00:02:01,672
Watu wengi wanafanya foleni, hivi?

37
00:02:01,695 --> 00:02:04,628
Hapa ni Sushi Dai.

38
00:02:04,651 --> 00:02:06,823
Sushi Dai?

39
00:02:06,847 --> 00:02:08,380
Ndiyo.

40
00:02:08,403 --> 00:02:11,338
Ni duka maarufu sana.

41
00:02:11,361 --> 00:02:14,495
Je, ni maarufu zaidi?

42
00:02:14,518 --> 00:02:15,931
Ndiyo.

43
00:02:15,954 --> 00:02:18,721
Kila wakati kuna foleni.

44
00:02:18,744 --> 00:02:21,912
Je, tutangoje kidogo?

45
00:02:21,935 --> 00:02:23,102
Ndiyo.

46
00:02:23,125 --> 00:02:24,892
Twende tufanye foleni.

47
00:02:24,915 --> 00:02:27,883
Kuna menyu nje.

48
00:02:27,906 --> 00:02:30,152
Unataka nini?

49
00:02:30,176 --> 00:02:33,309
Mimi napenda tuna.

50
00:02:33,332 --> 00:02:35,819
Nzuri sana.

51
00:02:35,842 --> 00:02:38,776
Kuna menyu ya seti pia.

52
00:02:38,799 --> 00:02:42,015
Kuna aina nyingi za samaki, hivi?

53
00:02:42,038 --> 00:02:44,805
Unataka kunywa nini?

54
00:02:44,829 --> 00:02:47,767
Nitapenda chai moto, tafadhali.

55
00:02:47,790 --> 00:02:50,403
Mimi pia nitakula hivyo.

56
00:02:50,427 --> 00:02:53,994
Sasa ni zamu yetu.

57
00:02:54,017 --> 00:02:57,217
Ndani ya duka hili ni safi sana, sivyo?

58
00:02:57,240 --> 00:03:00,019
Unaona fundi yule?

59
00:03:00,042 --> 00:03:02,976
Anaonekana mzuri sana!

60
00:03:02,999 --> 00:03:05,765
Sushi imekuja!

61
00:03:05,788 --> 00:03:08,476
Waa, inaonekana nzuri!

62
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:10,367
Tutakula sasa.

63
00:03:10,390 --> 00:03:13,928
Ina ladha sana!

64
00:03:13,951 --> 00:03:16,518
Samaki una ladha tamu!

65
00:03:16,541 --> 00:03:18,436
Ndiyo, kweli.

66
00:03:18,459 --> 00:03:21,547
Nimefurahi sana.

67
00:03:21,570 --> 00:03:28,675
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kuondolewa bila tahadhari.

68
00:03:28,675 --> 00:03:30,175
Sehemu ya 3: Jinsi ya Kuchagua Donburi ya Samaki / Jinsi ya Kuchagua Bakuli la Samaki

69
00:03:30,175 --> 00:03:34,142
Nina kitu kingine ninachotaka kula.

70
00:03:34,165 --> 00:03:35,532
Ni nini?

71
00:03:35,555 --> 00:03:38,521
Donburi ya samaki.

72
00:03:38,544 --> 00:03:41,979
Umeshakula sushi sasa hivi!

73
00:03:42,003 --> 00:03:44,836
Lakini ninataka kula.

74
00:03:44,859 --> 00:03:46,829
Nimeelewa.

75
00:03:46,853 --> 00:03:50,301
Twende dukani iitwayo Oedo.

76
00:03:50,324 --> 00:03:52,924
Je, hiyo ni maarufu pia?

77
00:03:52,947 --> 00:03:57,355
Ndiyo. Ni duka maarufu la donburi ya samaki.

78
00:03:57,379 --> 00:03:59,179
Hii ndiyo hapa?

79
00:03:59,202 --> 00:04:02,235
Kuna chaguo nyingi kwenye menyu.

80
00:04:02,258 --> 00:04:04,458
Utawachagua upi?

81
00:04:04,481 --> 00:04:07,748
Mimi nitachagua donburi ya ikura.

82
00:04:07,771 --> 00:04:11,538
Mimi nitachagua uni na ikura.

83
00:04:11,561 --> 00:04:13,961
Inaonekana ya kupendeza!

84
00:04:13,984 --> 00:04:17,075
Ndiyo, ninafurahi.

85
00:04:17,098 --> 00:04:19,732
Aa, imekuja!

86
00:04:19,755 --> 00:04:23,488
Waa, bakuli linang'aa!

87
00:04:23,511 --> 00:04:26,198
Je, utapaka shoyu?

88
00:04:26,222 --> 00:04:29,555
Ndiyo, nitapaka kidogo tu.

89
00:04:29,578 --> 00:04:31,476
Tutakula sasa.

90
00:04:31,500 --> 00:04:34,515
Hii ni bora sana!

91
00:04:34,538 --> 00:04:37,835
Uni una ladha tamu na unaoza kwa urahisi.

92
00:04:37,859 --> 00:04:41,025
Ikura ina mvuto.

93
00:04:41,048 --> 00:04:43,882
Ina ladha sana kweli.

94
00:04:43,905 --> 00:04:46,638
Hatuoni wali!

95
00:04:46,661 --> 00:04:50,428
Kuna samaki wengi juu yake.

96
00:04:50,451 --> 00:04:52,984
Ni wakati wa anasa.

97
00:04:53,007 --> 00:04:55,685
Oedo ina ladha nzuri, sivyo?

98
00:04:55,708 --> 00:04:59,566
Ndiyo, tutarudi tena bila shaka.

99
00:04:59,590 --> 00:05:01,090
Sehemu ya 4: Kutembelea Mnada wa Tuna / Kutembelea Mnada wa Samaki Mkubwa

100
00:05:01,090 --> 00:05:04,534
Twende kuangalia mnada wa tuna.

101
00:05:04,558 --> 00:05:07,047
Unaweza kuuona wapi?

102
00:05:07,070 --> 00:05:10,204
Kuna njia ya ziara.

103
00:05:10,227 --> 00:05:12,660
Je, ni mbali kutoka hapa?

104
00:05:12,683 --> 00:05:15,776
Hapana. Karibu sana.

105
00:05:15,799 --> 00:05:19,092
Kuna samaki aina ya tunu nyingi, sivyo?

106
00:05:19,116 --> 00:05:22,882
Ndiyo. Ni kubwa sana!

107
00:05:22,905 --> 00:05:25,939
Je, ndani ya soko hapa kuna baridi?

108
00:05:25,962 --> 00:05:29,095
Kidogo tu.

109
00:05:29,118 --> 00:05:31,595
Nimeleta jaketi yangu.

110
00:05:31,619 --> 00:05:34,595
Vizuri umefanya.

111
00:05:34,618 --> 00:05:38,088
Wale watu wanafanya nini?

112
00:05:38,112 --> 00:05:42,151
Wanafanya bei ya samaki wa tunu.

113
00:05:42,174 --> 00:05:45,648
Sauti yao haieleweki vizuri.

114
00:05:45,672 --> 00:05:47,909
Kwa sababu kuna glasi.

115
00:05:47,932 --> 00:05:51,466
Lakini ni ya kufurahisha sana.

116
00:05:51,489 --> 00:05:54,689
Nimefurahi sana niliweza kuona.

117
00:05:54,712 --> 00:05:57,846
Kwa kawaida huanzia saa ngapi?

118
00:05:57,869 --> 00:06:01,044
Huanzia saa kumi na moja usiku (5:30 asubuhi).

119
00:06:01,067 --> 00:06:03,712
Ni mapema sana!

120
00:06:03,735 --> 00:06:08,183
Ndiyo. Sisi tulichelewa kidogo.

121
00:06:08,206 --> 00:06:11,419
Tuliona kidogo tu.

122
00:06:11,443 --> 00:06:15,702
Ndiyo. Tutakuja tena baadaye.

123
00:06:15,726 --> 00:06:18,759
Lazima tuamke mapema.

124
00:06:18,782 --> 00:06:20,749
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

125
00:06:20,772 --> 00:06:24,539
Lakini sasa nimeelewa hali ya soko hapa.

126
00:06:24,562 --> 00:06:28,328
Tuchukue picha hapa, basi?

127
00:06:28,351 --> 00:06:30,385
Ndiyo, tafadhali.

128
00:06:30,408 --> 00:06:32,974
Picha nzuri imetokana!

129
00:06:32,997 --> 00:06:35,131
Asante sana.

130
00:06:35,153 --> 00:06:36,653
Sehemu ya 5: Kununua Kisu cha Kukumbukia / Chagua Kisu cha Zawadi

131
00:06:36,653 --> 00:06:39,654
Tununue zawadi.

132
00:06:39,678 --> 00:06:41,811
Unataka nini?

133
00:06:41,834 --> 00:06:44,853
Kuna duka la visu.

134
00:06:44,877 --> 00:06:47,244
Ningependa kuona.

135
00:06:47,267 --> 00:06:49,279
Twende.

136
00:06:49,302 --> 00:06:52,468
Kuna visu vingi hapa.

137
00:06:52,491 --> 00:06:55,091
Vinaonekana vizuri sana!

138
00:06:55,114 --> 00:06:58,481
Vinaonekana vina katwa vizuri sana.

139
00:06:58,504 --> 00:07:01,271
Ni zana za wataalamu.

140
00:07:01,294 --> 00:07:04,694
Mimi pia napenda kupika.

141
00:07:04,717 --> 00:07:07,321
Je, utanunua moja?

142
00:07:07,344 --> 00:07:10,230
Bei yake ni ngapi?

143
00:07:10,253 --> 00:07:13,226
Kama elfu kumi za Kijapani.

144
00:07:13,250 --> 00:07:16,384
Ni ghali kidogo.

145
00:07:16,407 --> 00:07:20,340
Lakini utatumia kwa muda mrefu.

146
00:07:20,363 --> 00:07:21,963
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

147
00:07:21,986 --> 00:07:26,353
Unaweza kuandika jina lako kwenye kisu.

148
00:07:26,376 --> 00:07:29,242
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

149
00:07:29,265 --> 00:07:32,465
Ni zawadi nzuri pia.

150
00:07:32,488 --> 00:07:35,088
Ningependa kununua kwa baba yangu.

151
00:07:35,112 --> 00:07:38,201
Hakika atafurahi sana.

152
00:07:38,225 --> 00:07:39,991
Samahani.

153
00:07:40,014 --> 00:07:42,348
Nionyeshe hiki, tafadhali.

154
00:07:42,371 --> 00:07:45,538
Kisu hiki ni kizuri sana!

155
00:07:45,562 --> 00:07:48,496
Nitachukua hiki.

156
00:07:48,519 --> 00:07:51,452
Umefanya mnunzi mwema.

157
00:07:51,475 --> 00:07:55,008
Ndiyo. Ninafurahi sana.

158
00:07:55,031 --> 00:07:57,764
Ninawasubiri kwa furaha kutumia.

159
00:07:57,787 --> 00:08:01,266
Ndiyo. Nitajitahidi kupika vyema.

160
00:08:01,290 --> 00:08:04,056
Tumia kwa tahadhari.

161
00:08:04,079 --> 00:08:06,646
Hakika.

162
00:08:06,669 --> 00:08:08,169
Sehemu ya 6: Dukani ya Tamagoyaki ya Marutake / Marutake: Duka Maarufu la Tamagoyaki ya Kijapani

163
00:08:08,169 --> 00:08:12,202
Kuna harufu tamu huko.

164
00:08:12,225 --> 00:08:14,643
Hiyo ni Marutake.

165
00:08:14,667 --> 00:08:18,350
Marutake ni duka la nini?

166
00:08:18,373 --> 00:08:21,574
Ni duka la tamagoyaki (mayai ya kuchoma ya Kijapani).

167
00:08:21,598 --> 00:08:23,896
Je, ni duka maarufu?

168
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:27,453
Ndiyo. Ni maarufu sana.

169
00:08:27,476 --> 00:08:30,365
Tujaribu moja.

170
00:08:30,389 --> 00:08:32,789
Imepachikwa kwenye ubao.

171
00:08:32,812 --> 00:08:35,045
Ni rahisi kula.

172
00:08:35,068 --> 00:08:38,268
Ni moto, angalia.

173
00:08:38,291 --> 00:08:40,324
Tutakula sasa.

174
00:08:40,347 --> 00:08:42,715
Ina ladha gani?

175
00:08:42,739 --> 00:08:45,539
Ni tamu sana.

176
00:08:45,562 --> 00:08:48,330
Inaonekana kama keki.

177
00:08:48,353 --> 00:08:51,156
Ndiyo. Ni laini sana.

178
00:08:51,180 --> 00:08:53,954
Ninaona ladha ya dashi.

179
00:08:53,977 --> 00:08:57,813
Tamagoyaki ya Kijapani ni tamu sana.

180
00:08:57,836 --> 00:09:00,609
Tununue kama zawadi?

181
00:09:00,632 --> 00:09:04,166
Ndiyo. Nataka kununua kwa ajili ya familia yangu.

182
00:09:04,189 --> 00:09:06,407
Je, inaweza kudumu siku kadhaa?

183
00:09:06,430 --> 00:09:09,564
Tujue kwa mtu wa dukani.

184
00:09:09,587 --> 00:09:13,244
Wanasema inaweza kudumu siku tatu kwenye jokofu.

185
00:09:13,267 --> 00:09:15,701
Basi, hakuna matatizo.

186
00:09:15,725 --> 00:09:18,492
Tununue ile kubwa.

187
00:09:18,515 --> 00:09:21,481
Nawaombea watafurahi.

188
00:09:21,504 --> 00:09:24,590
Hakika watafurahi.

189
00:09:24,614 --> 00:09:28,663
Tamagoyaki ya Marutake ni bora kabisa.

190
00:09:28,687 --> 00:09:31,654
Ndiyo. Nataka kula tena.

191
00:09:31,677 --> 00:09:34,643
Kuna maduka mengine pia.

192
00:09:34,666 --> 00:09:37,100
Tazama mengi.

193
00:09:37,123 --> 00:09:38,623
Sehemu ya 7: Pumziko na Dango / Pumziko na Dango

194
00:09:38,623 --> 00:09:41,518
Nimechoka kidogo.

195
00:09:41,541 --> 00:09:44,633
Tupumzike mahali fulani.

196
00:09:44,657 --> 00:09:48,143
Kuna duka la Modsu Dango.

197
00:09:48,166 --> 00:09:51,166
Modsu Dango?

198
00:09:51,189 --> 00:09:55,882
Ndiyo. Ni duka la zamani la wagashi.

199
00:09:55,906 --> 00:09:59,073
Dango ni tamu?

200
00:09:59,096 --> 00:10:03,029
Ndiyo. Ni tamu sana.

201
00:10:03,052 --> 00:10:05,942
Je, naweza kunywa chai?

202
00:10:05,965 --> 00:10:09,765
Ndiyo. Kuna chai moto.

203
00:10:09,788 --> 00:10:12,222
Tuingie ndani.

204
00:10:12,245 --> 00:10:14,982
Utawachagua upi?

205
00:10:15,005 --> 00:10:18,973
Mimi nitakula dango ya anko.

206
00:10:18,996 --> 00:10:22,263
Mimi nitakula dango ya mchuzi wa soya.

207
00:10:22,286 --> 00:10:24,286
Nzuri sana.

208
00:10:24,309 --> 00:10:26,883
Tafadhali, na chai pia.

209
00:10:26,907 --> 00:10:29,040
Tutakula sasa.

210
00:10:29,063 --> 00:10:32,238
Tango ni laini sana.

211
00:10:32,262 --> 00:10:36,195
Anko ni tamu na ladha nzuri.

212
00:10:36,218 --> 00:10:40,307
Inakwenda vizuri na chai.

213
00:10:40,331 --> 00:10:42,465
Inakuletea utulivu.

214
00:10:42,488 --> 00:10:45,904
Dango ya Mosuke ni maarufu sana.

215
00:10:45,928 --> 00:10:49,468
Kuna wateja wengi hapa, sivyo?

216
00:10:49,491 --> 00:10:51,661
Ndiyo, kweli.

217
00:10:51,685 --> 00:10:54,519
Nilipata kupumzika vizuri.

218
00:10:54,542 --> 00:10:57,435
Unaweza kununua zawadi pia.

219
00:10:57,459 --> 00:11:00,259
Tununue baadaye.

220
00:11:00,282 --> 00:11:04,057
Wagashi ya Kijapani ni ajabu sana!

221
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:07,714
Ndiyo, napenda sana pia.

222
00:11:07,737 --> 00:11:11,633
Sasa, twende mahali pengine.

223
00:11:11,656 --> 00:11:14,825
Ndiyo. Twende!

224
00:11:14,849 --> 00:11:16,349
Sehemu ya 8: Dukani kwa Samaki Kukaanga / Mgahawa wa Samaki Kukaanga

225
00:11:16,349 --> 00:11:20,149
Unaweza kula bado?

226
00:11:20,172 --> 00:11:22,985
Ndiyo, sijambo.

227
00:11:23,009 --> 00:11:25,575
Twende Odabo.

228
00:11:25,598 --> 00:11:29,400
Odabo ni duka la nini?

229
00:11:29,423 --> 00:11:32,504
Ni duka la vyakula vya kukaanga.

230
00:11:32,528 --> 00:11:35,202
Samaki wa kukaanga?

231
00:11:35,226 --> 00:11:39,712
Ndiyo. Ajifurai ni maarufu sana hapa.

232
00:11:39,735 --> 00:11:42,785
Inaonekana tamu sana.

233
00:11:42,809 --> 00:11:46,142
Duka liko huko.

234
00:11:46,165 --> 00:11:48,578
Tazama menyu.

235
00:11:48,602 --> 00:11:51,668
Kuna kukaanga chaza pia.

236
00:11:51,691 --> 00:11:55,825
Mimi nitachukua Ajifurai.

237
00:11:55,848 --> 00:11:59,081
Mimi nitachukua kukaanga chaza.

238
00:11:59,104 --> 00:12:02,039
Nigawie kidogo tafadhali.

239
00:12:02,062 --> 00:12:04,829
Ndiyo, hakuna matata.

240
00:12:04,852 --> 00:12:07,485
Chakula kimefika.

241
00:12:07,508 --> 00:12:11,585
Ajifurai ni kubwa mno!

242
00:12:11,608 --> 00:12:14,382
Inasikika sauti ya krispi sana.

243
00:12:14,406 --> 00:12:17,773
Ndani ni laini mno.

244
00:12:17,796 --> 00:12:20,629
Unataka kuweka sauce?

245
00:12:20,652 --> 00:12:23,349
Ndiyo, nitaweka.

246
